    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[UniFi Access Point 7.0.85]]></title>
        <id>fe1259cb-fb08-4137-8c69-66c7c83ffca7</id>
        <link href="https://community.ui.com/releases/UniFi-Access-Point-7-0-85/fe1259cb-fb08-4137-8c69-66c7c83ffca7"/>
        <updated>2024-12-03T07:46:32.000Z</updated>
        <summary type="html"><![CDATA[Overview
* This release is the initial release for the E7.
E7 is an enterprise-grade indoor access point delivering 10-stream Wi-Fi 7 performance for unmatched wireless connectivity. Equipped with two Ethernet ports—10GbE and 1GbE—it ensures power and data redundancy, providing increased reliability for critical operations. The E7 features a dedicated scanning radio, enabling real-time spectrum analysis.


Additional information
If you encounter any issues with this release, please provide us with some details on your setup and include the below information:

AP model(s)
Previous AP release version
UniFi Network application version]]></summary>
        <author>
            <name>UI-Edmundas</name>
        </author>
    </entry>
